<title>USA: Hempstead, N.Y., $82 mln GO sale moved to Feb 13.</title>
<headline>Hempstead, N.Y., $82 mln GO sale moved to Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hempstead, N.Y.'s $82 million general obligation bond sale has been moved to February 13 from February 14.</p>
<p>The bonds will be auctioned at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
